{"unit_id":"edusrez__dsh-smart-restart#feature-1-restart-notice","repo":"edusrez/dsh-smart-restart","commit":"dbceb31183cbab5c4ee99dcd6b8cda755d549695","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-restart 的功能「重启检测与通知」：插件比较磁盘上的上次启动标记与当前进程，检测服务重启后把启动时间、停机时长和可用的中断会话信息送到目标 agent 会话。通知由会话启动事件触发，并有有限时长的轮询补发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:327-385","src/index.ts:677-705","src/boot.ts:33-44"]}
{"unit_id":"edusrez__dsh-smart-restart#feature-2-smart-restart","repo":"edusrez/dsh-smart-restart","commit":"dbceb31183cbab5c4ee99dcd6b8cda755d549695","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-restart 的功能「安全重启工具」：agent 可请求通过 systemd 重启；工具先检查其他活动会话，并可等待空闲或执行显式覆盖。重启后通知回到调用会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:895-928","src/index.ts:1354-1384"]}
{"unit_id":"edusrez__dsh-smart-restart#feature-3-shutdown-resume","repo":"edusrez/dsh-smart-restart","commit":"dbceb31183cbab5c4ee99dcd6b8cda755d549695","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-restart 的功能「活动会话关机续接」：服务收到 SIGTERM 或 SIGINT 时记录 grace 时间窗内活动的会话；下一次启动读取该记录并优先把通知送回最近活动的会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:818-861","src/index.ts:387-404"]}
{"unit_id":"edusrez__dsh-smart-restart#feature-4-canary","repo":"edusrez/dsh-smart-restart","commit":"dbceb31183cbab5c4ee99dcd6b8cda755d549695","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-smart-restart 的功能「可选重启前 canary 检查」：启用 canary 后，重启工具先尝试在临时目录和本地端口启动一个临时 DSH 实例并探测健康状态；检查失败会中止正式重启，未能确定启动目标时则跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:147-160","src/index.ts:895-917","src/canary.ts:2190-2200"]}
